With all schemes, we do a lot of research into the typical buyer profiling.

00:32:51.080 --> 00:32:53.720
Wow!

00:32:53.400 --> 00:32:54.880
Yes!

00:32:53.960 --> 00:33:01.800
There's 144 apartments so there's a limit to the amount of local market that you can tap into.

00:33:01.600 --> 00:33:03.960
That's great.

00:33:03.040 --> 00:33:04.800
Arms out.

00:33:04.000 --> 00:33:07.000
Try and get that light behind you there.

00:33:06.160 --> 00:33:08.040
We are good to go!

00:33:09.040 --> 00:33:25.200
We'll be launching within the next three to four months off-plan, certainly nothing to show for, because the building is very much as you have seen in its undressed state at the moment and getting worse before it'll get better.

00:33:24.520 --> 00:33:27.160
Yeah, perfecto!

00:33:27.480 --> 00:33:33.360
So what we've got to do is convince people that it's a good investment.

00:33:32.760 --> 00:33:41.000
The aspiration of this development is the water, riverside living, and in an area that is very much on the up, is very much...

00:33:40.160 --> 00:33:46.800
Again, it's documented as to what they're doing to the Pepys estate, the regeneration.

00:33:45.880 --> 00:33:48.520
OK, lovely.

00:33:48.840 --> 00:33:53.960
And to be part of that from our point of view is quite exciting.

00:33:54.960 --> 00:33:58.440
And people will buy into that.

00:33:57.720 --> 00:34:01.800
The question is, at what stage they'll buy into it.

00:34:01.080 --> 00:34:03.400
Excuse me.

00:34:03.040 --> 00:34:05.160
Last one, here we go.

00:34:04.240 --> 00:34:06.000
Perfect!

