She was waiting for the cheque and she ain't come back to see if it's here.

00:34:22.800 --> 00:34:29.280
I know it's the cheque she is waiting for because there's letters from the DSS.

00:34:28.639 --> 00:34:31.239
She will want to have drugs.

00:34:30.320 --> 00:34:34.120
If I give her £600 she will want to buy drugs straightaway.

